  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where innate ability is enhanced by technology and turned into a supernatural power called \"Talent\". In a world where this power can be used, the strength of the ability is everything! This is the story of a disgraced power user, Seiji Tsukimomo, who can only use his powers when kissing a girl, and a brutal woman, Kamo, who cannot use her powers. This is the story of two people who strive to be the strongest in a Talent academy together.",
   "ja": "俺「月桃誠司」は、たいした超能力も持たないへっぽこ学生。そんな俺の前に学園唯一の無能力者・加茂浪漫が現れて「元の世界に戻りたいっ！」とか言い出した!?　それって俺とアイツしか知らないハズはずなのに…。"
  },
